{"title":"Career Roadmap · IT Support","role":"IT Support","summary":"An IT Support professional helps users and organizations resolve hardware, software, networking, account-access, application, and basic security issues. The role typically includes troubleshooting incidents, installing/configuring systems, managing user accounts, documenting solutions, and escalating complex problems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Computer Applications"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An IT Support professional helps users and organizations resolve hardware, software, networking, account-access, application, and basic security issues. The role typically includes troubleshooting incidents, installing/configuring systems, managing user accounts, documenting solutions, and escalating complex problems."},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com – Computer Applications graduate, IT Support is a practical interdisciplinary pathway because the degree combines business processes, computer applications, databases, office productivity, and basic IT knowledge."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Troubleshooting","Networking","Windows/Linux","Cloud","Microsoft 365/Google Workspace","Security","Ticketing","Automation"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Typical Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"IT Foundation & Entry"},{"text":"IT Support Intern → Help Desk / IT Support Technician"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Infrastructure Specialization"},{"text":"System Administrator / Network Support / Cloud Support"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Engineering & Leadership"},{"text":"Senior SysAdmin / Cloud Engineer / IT Operations Lead"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Architecture / Management"},{"text":"IT Manager / Infrastructure Architect / IT Operations Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Computer & IT Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong understanding of how computers and business IT environments work."},{"type":"h","text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computer hardware"},{"text":"CPU"},{"text":"RAM"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Motherboards"},{"text":"Peripherals"},{"text":"BIOS/UEFI"},{"text":"Operating systems"},{"text":"File systems"},{"text":"Drivers"},{"text":"Printers"},{"text":"Basic troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand common hardware problems such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"System not booting"},{"text":"Slow computer"},{"text":"Disk problems"},{"text":"Memory issues"},{"text":"Driver failures"},{"text":"Peripheral failures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operating Systems"},{"type":"h","text":"Windows"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Windows installation"},{"text":"User accounts"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Device Manager"},{"text":"Task Manager"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"Event Viewer"},{"text":"Disk Management"},{"text":"Windows Update"},{"text":"System Restore"},{"text":"Group Policy fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ubuntu"},{"text":"Terminal"},{"text":"File permissions"},{"text":"Users/groups"},{"text":"Processes"},{"text":"Packages"},{"text":"SSH"},{"text":"Logs"},{"text":"Basic shell commands"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important commands include:"},{"type":"p","text":"ls"},{"type":"p","text":"cd"},{"type":"p","text":"cp"},{"type":"p","text":"mv"},{"type":"p","text":"rm"},{"type":"p","text":"mkdir"},{"type":"p","text":"cat"},{"type":"p","text":"grep"},{"type":"p","text":"chmod"},{"type":"p","text":"chown"},{"type":"p","text":"ps"},{"type":"p","text":"top"},{"type":"p","text":"df"},{"type":"p","text":"du"},{"type":"p","text":"ping"},{"type":"p","text":"ssh"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Networking & IT Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking is one of the most important skills for IT Support."},{"type":"h","text":"Networking fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IP addresses"},{"text":"IPv4"},{"text":"IPv6 basics"},{"text":"MAC addresses"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"TCP/IP"},{"text":"HTTP/HTTPS"},{"text":"FTP/SFTP"},{"text":"SMTP"},{"text":"VPN"},{"text":"NAT"},{"text":"Firewalls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Network devices"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Routers"},{"text":"Switches"},{"text":"Access points"},{"text":"Firewalls"},{"text":"Modems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Troubleshooting"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to use:"},{"type":"p","text":"ping"},{"type":"p","text":"ipconfig / ifconfig"},{"type":"p","text":"tracert / traceroute"},{"type":"p","text":"nslookup"},{"type":"p","text":"netstat"},{"type":"p","text":"arp"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how to diagnose:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Device","Network","Router","DNS","Internet","Application"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — User & Application Support"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to troubleshoot common business applications."},{"type":"h","text":"Common support areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Office"},{"text":"Microsoft 365"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Browsers"},{"text":"Email"},{"text":"Printers"},{"text":"VPN"},{"text":"File sharing"},{"text":"Video conferencing"},{"text":"Business applications"},{"text":"Password problems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"User account management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User creation"},{"text":"Password resets"},{"text":"Access permissions"},{"text":"Role-based access"},{"text":"MFA"},{"text":"Account lockouts"},{"text":"Offboarding"},{"text":"Access reviews"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ticketing & IT Service Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Professional IT Support is highly process-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incident management"},{"text":"Service requests"},{"text":"Problem management"},{"text":"Change management"},{"text":"SLA"},{"text":"Escalation"},{"text":"Knowledge base"},{"text":"Root-cause analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ticket workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Reports Problem","Ticket Created","Categorization","Priority","Troubleshooting","Resolution","Documentation","Ticket Closure"]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand ITIL fundamentals and service-management concepts."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Enterprise IT & Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"The third year should move beyond basic help-desk work."},{"type":"h","text":"Active Directory / Identity"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Active Directory"},{"text":"Domains"},{"text":"Users"},{"text":"Groups"},{"text":"Organizational Units"},{"text":"Group Policy"},{"text":"Permissions"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Authorization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand modern identity concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Entra ID"},{"text":"Single Sign-On"},{"text":"MFA"},{"text":"Conditional access"},{"text":"Identity lifecycle"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one cloud platform first."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft Azure"},{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For an IT Support professional, understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Virtual machines"},{"text":"Cloud storage"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Security groups"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Backups"},{"text":"Cloud identities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Support workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["User/Application","Identity","Network","Cloud Resource","Logs/Monitoring","Troubleshooting"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Automation, Security & Professional Readiness"},{"type":"p","text":"If the B.Com is a 3-year program, compress this stage into the final semester and internship period."},{"type":"h","text":"PowerShell"},{"type":"p","text":"PowerShell is highly valuable for Windows/enterprise support."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Commands"},{"text":"Objects"},{"text":"Pipelines"},{"text":"Files"},{"text":"Processes"},{"text":"Services"},{"text":"User management"},{"text":"Basic automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example automation tasks:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Create user accounts"},{"text":"Check disk space"},{"text":"Collect system information"},{"text":"Restart services"},{"text":"Generate reports"},{"text":"Check inactive accounts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python or Bash"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one secondary scripting language."},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"API interaction"},{"text":"Log processing"},{"text":"File processing"},{"text":"Monitoring scripts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Bash"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linux administration"},{"text":"Server automation"},{"text":"Log processing"},{"text":"Scheduled tasks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"IT Security Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Every IT Support professional should understand basic security."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Password security"},{"text":"MFA"},{"text":"Endpoint security"},{"text":"Antivirus/EDR concepts"},{"text":"Phishing"},{"text":"Malware"},{"text":"Social engineering"},{"text":"Least privilege"},{"text":"Patch management"},{"text":"Encryption basics"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"Security logging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Security incident example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Suspicious Email","User Reports","Account Investigation","Credential Reset","MFA Verification","Endpoint Scan","Security Escalation","Documentation"]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Projects"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — IT Help Desk System"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simple ticketing system supporting:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User registration"},{"text":"Ticket creation"},{"text":"Priority"},{"text":"Category"},{"text":"Assignment"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Comments"},{"text":"Resolution"},{"text":"Ticket history"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This can demonstrate both the B.Com Computer Applications and IT-support aspects of the degree."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Network Troubleshooting Lab"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a virtual network using tools such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cisco Packet Tracer"},{"text":"VirtualBox"},{"text":"VMware"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practice:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IP configuration"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"Routing"},{"text":"Connectivity testing"},{"text":"Network troubleshooting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Windows Administration Lab"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small simulated business environment."},{"type":"p","text":"Configure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Domain","Users","Groups","Permissions","Shared Folders","Group Policies","Access Control"]},{"type":"p","text":"Document every configuration and troubleshooting procedure."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — IT Asset Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee"},{"text":"Laptop/desktop"},{"text":"Serial number"},{"text":"Software"},{"text":"Warranty"},{"text":"Purchase date"},{"text":"Assignment"},{"text":"Repair history"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dashboard using:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel/Power BI + database"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Cloud Support Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Deploy a simple application or service in AWS/Azure and document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"VM"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Backup"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create troubleshooting scenarios such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Instance unreachable"},{"text":"DNS failure"},{"text":"Permission denied"},{"text":"Disk full"},{"text":"Service unavailable"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying during the second or third year."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IT Support Intern"},{"text":"Help Desk Intern"},{"text":"Technical Support Intern"},{"text":"System Administration Intern"},{"text":"Network Support Intern"},{"text":"IT Operations Intern"},{"text":"Cloud Support Intern"},{"text":"Infrastructure Support Intern"},{"text":"Desktop Support Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong internship environments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IT service companies"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"Corporate offices"},{"text":"Managed service providers"},{"text":"Cloud service companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain experience with real ticketing systems, user accounts, networking, endpoint management and troubleshooting, rather than only hardware repair."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"IT Support"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IT Support Technician"},{"text":"IT Support Executive"},{"text":"IT Support Engineer"},{"text":"Help Desk Technician"},{"text":"Service Desk Analyst"},{"text":"Desktop Support Engineer"},{"text":"Technical Support Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Infrastructure"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Junior System Administrator"},{"text":"Network Support Technician"},{"text":"IT Operations Associate"},{"text":"Infrastructure Support Engineer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"With additional cloud training:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cloud Support Associate"},{"text":"Junior Cloud Support Engineer"},{"text":"Cloud Operations Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Requirement","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"User support"},{"text":"Troubleshooting"}],[{"text":"Desktop support"},{"text":"Windows + hardware"}],[{"text":"Network troubleshooting"},{"text":"TCP/IP, DNS, DHCP"}],[{"text":"Account management"},{"text":"AD / Entra ID"}],[{"text":"Ticket management"},{"text":"ITSM"}],[{"text":"Microsoft environment"},{"text":"Microsoft 365"}],[{"text":"Linux support"},{"text":"Linux fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Automation"},{"text":"PowerShell"}],[{"text":"Cloud support"},{"text":"AWS/Azure/GCP"}],[{"text":"Security"},{"text":"Endpoint + identity security"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Knowledge base"}],[{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"ITSM + troubleshooting"}],[{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Logs + monitoring tools"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"User communication"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications can be particularly useful for an IT Support entry-level candidate."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong foundational options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CompTIA A+"},{"text":"CompTIA Network+"},{"text":"CompTIA Security+"},{"text":"ITIL Foundation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Microsoft"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider learning toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft 365 administration"},{"text":"Azure fundamentals"},{"text":"Azure administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AWS"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS Cloud Practitioner"},{"text":"AWS-focused cloud support learning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Certification choice should follow the skills being developed rather than becoming the primary goal."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG is not required to enter IT Support."},{"type":"p","text":"Possible options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"M.Sc Computer Science"},{"text":"M.Sc Information Technology"},{"text":"MBA IT"},{"text":"MBA Technology Management"},{"text":"M.Sc Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Master's in Cloud Computing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, for early IT Support careers, hands-on labs, troubleshooting experience and certifications can be more valuable than immediately pursuing a general master's degree."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"1. System Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Windows Server"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Active Directory"},{"text":"PowerShell"},{"text":"Virtualization"},{"text":"Backup"},{"text":"Monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","System Administrator","Senior SysAdmin","Infrastructure Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Network Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Routing"},{"text":"Switching"},{"text":"Firewalls"},{"text":"VPN"},{"text":"DNS"},{"text":"DHCP"},{"text":"Network monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","Network Support","Network Administrator","Network Engineer"]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Cloud Support"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS/Azure"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Virtual machines"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Storage"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","Cloud Support","Cloud Engineer","Senior Cloud Engineer"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Cybersecurity"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Endpoint security"},{"text":"Identity"},{"text":"SIEM"},{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"Vulnerability management"},{"text":"Security monitoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","Security Operations","SOC Analyst","Security Engineer"]},{"type":"h","text":"5. IT Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PowerShell"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"},{"text":"Configuration management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Path:"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","Systems Automation","Cloud/DevOps Engineer"]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"General route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com – Computer Applications","IT Support Intern","IT Support / Help Desk","Senior IT Support Engineer","System / Network / Cloud Specialist","IT Operations Lead","IT Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud route"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","Cloud Support","Cloud Engineer","Senior Cloud Engineer","Cloud Architect / Cloud Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Security route"},{"type":"flow","items":["IT Support","Security Support","SOC Analyst","Security Engineer","Senior Security Engineer","Security Architect / Security Lead"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Technologies"},{"type":"p","text":"The IT Support profession is increasingly changing through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-powered IT service management"},{"text":"AIOps"},{"text":"Automated ticket classification"},{"text":"AI troubleshooting assistants"},{"text":"Endpoint management"},{"text":"Zero Trust"},{"text":"Cloud-native infrastructure"},{"text":"Remote device management"},{"text":"Infrastructure automation"},{"text":"Observability"},{"text":"Identity-first security"},{"text":"Self-service IT portals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future IT professional should therefore move beyond basic password resets and become capable of troubleshooting infrastructure, automating repetitive work, and supporting cloud and identity environments."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Core IT"},{"type":"p","text":"Computer Hardware"},{"type":"p","text":"Windows"},{"type":"p","text":"Linux"},{"type":"p","text":"Troubleshooting"},{"type":"p","text":"Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"TCP/IP"},{"type":"p","text":"DNS"},{"type":"p","text":"DHCP"},{"type":"h","text":"Enterprise"},{"type":"p","text":"Active Directory"},{"type":"p","text":"Entra ID"},{"type":"p","text":"Microsoft 365"},{"type":"p","text":"ITSM"},{"type":"p","text":"Ticketing"},{"type":"p","text":"SLA"},{"type":"p","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud"},{"type":"p","text":"AWS / Azure"},{"type":"p","text":"IAM"},{"type":"p","text":"Virtual Machines"},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud Networking"},{"type":"p","text":"Storage"},{"type":"p","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"PowerShell"},{"type":"p","text":"Python/Bash"},{"type":"p","text":"APIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Task Automation"},{"type":"h","text":"Security"},{"type":"p","text":"MFA"},{"type":"p","text":"Endpoint Security"},{"type":"p","text":"Patch Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Least Privilege"},{"type":"p","text":"Phishing Awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"SIEM Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Docker"},{"type":"p","text":"Cloud Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"AIOps"},{"type":"p","text":"Infrastructure as Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Zero Trust"},{"type":"p","text":"Observability"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to troubleshoot a typical business IT problem systematically:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Issue","Identify Symptoms","Collect Information","Check Device","Check Network","Check Identity/Permissions","Check Application","Review Logs","Resolve / Escalate","Document Solution"]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should ideally have one IT support internship, a virtual Windows/Linux lab, networking practice, Active Directory exposure, basic cloud experience, PowerShell skills, and documented troubleshooting projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Com – Computer Applications → IT Support is a practical interdisciplinary route, particularly for students who want to combine business knowledge with technology without immediately pursuing a pure software-development career."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest employability combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Windows","Networking","ITSM","Active Directory/Entra ID","Microsoft 365","PowerShell","Cloud","Security Fundamentals."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For long-term growth, the student should avoid remaining limited to basic help-desk tasks. A better strategy is to specialize into System Administration, Network Engineering, Cloud Support/Engineering, Cybersecurity, or IT Automation. This creates a progression from IT Support → Technical Specialist → Engineer → Lead/Architect/IT Manager."}]}]}